        <kb-reference-title>ControlLogix 5570 and 5560 Controllers</kb-reference-title>
        <kb-abstract>There are five types of ControlLogix controllers available. These types include the following: Standard ControlLogix controllers, Extreme environment ControlLogix controllers, Armor™ ControlLogix controllers, Standard GuardLogix® controllers, Armor GuardLogix controllers. This manual explains how to use standard, extreme environment, and Armor ControlLogix controllers.</kb-abstract>
