    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://d3fend.mitre.org/ontologies/d3fend.owl#ApplicationProtocolCommandAnalysis">
        <definition>Analyzing application protocol level remote commands to detect unauthorized activity.</definition>
        <kb-article>## How it works
This technique requires the ability to parse application layer protocols to understand the commands being sent to a remote service. Signature-based or statistical analysis may be employed to identify unauthorized commands being sent. These commands can be observed by monitoring network traffic or application logs.</kb-article>
        <rdfs:label>Application Protocol Command Analysis</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
