    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://d3fend.mitre.org/ontologies/d3fend.owl#BayesOptimalClassifier">
        <definition>A probabilistic model that makes the most probable prediction for a new example.</definition>
        <kb-article>## References
Bayes Optimal Classifier. Machine Learning Mastery.  [Link](https://machinelearningmastery.com/bayes-optimal-classifier/).
Ensemble learning. Wikipedia.  [Link](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ensemble_learning).</kb-article>
