    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://d3fend.mitre.org/ontologies/d3fend.owl#BayesianEstimation">
        <definition>A Bayes estimator or a Bayes action is an estimator or decision rule that minimizes the posterior expected value of a loss function (i.e., the posterior expected loss).</definition>
