    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://d3fend.mitre.org/ontologies/d3fend.owl#CreateThread">
        <definition>Threads are an execution model that exists independently from a language, as well as a parallel execution model. They enable a program to control multiple different flows of work that overlap in time.</definition>
