    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://d3fend.mitre.org/ontologies/d3fend.owl#DeonticLogic">
        <definition>Deontic logic addresses the modality of obligations and norms; i.e., the modality of morality.</definition>
        <kb-article>## References
1. Deontic logic. (2023, June 4). In _Wikipedia_. [Link](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Modal_logic#Deontic_logic)</kb-article>
        <rdfs:label>Deontic Logic</rdfs:label>
