Policy Gradients in a Nutshell. Towards Data Science.  [Link](https://towardsdatascience.com/policy-gradients-in-a-nutshell-8b72f9743c5d).</kb-article>
        <rdfs:label>Policy Gradient</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://d3fend.mitre.org/ontologies/d3fend.owl#PowerShellProfileScript">
        <definition>A PowerShell profile script is a script that runs when PowerShell starts and can be used as a logon script to customize user environments.</definition>
        <rdfs:label>PowerShell Profile Script</rdfs:label>
